<title>UK: LW Rentenbank sets 12 billion peseta step-up bond.</title>
<headline>LW Rentenbank sets 12 billion peseta step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BBV.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDWIRTSCHAFTLICHE RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    12.0 BLN PTA  COUPON    *5.68 PCT  MATURITY    03.MAR.03</p>
<p> TYPE    STEP-UP	ISS PRICE  101.35    PAY DATE    03.MAR.97</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR YEARS ONE TO THREE, 6.60 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>		*CALL AFTER THREE YEARS</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AIAF	GOV LAW    SPANISH</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.5 PCT   SELL CONC  1.0 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
